      "name": "FreeIndexTree",
      "signature": "void FreeIndexTree(void * pIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Frees an index tree structure and all its associated nodes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pIndex is not NULL (assert if NULL)\n2. Get tree root at pIndex+0xc\n3. If tree root exists, recursively free left (offset 0x24) and right (offset 0x28) children\n4. Free tree root via FreePoolMemoryTracked\n5. Free the index structure itself\n\nParameters:\n- pIndex (void*): Pointer to index structure containing tree at offset 0xc\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset | Size | Field       |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| 0x0C   | 4    | pTreeRoot   |\n\nTree Node Layout (at pTreeRoot):\n| Offset | Size | Field       |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| 0x24   | 4    | pLeftChild  |\n| 0x28   | 4    | pRightChild |",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:11453ff0754b5bb7244cfaee2a241de8",
