      "name": "GetAsyncResult",
      "signature": "int GetAsyncResult(int * pAsyncData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Gets the result value from an async operation, waiting for completion if needed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert pAsyncData is not NULL\n2. Validate magic signature (0x41737960 masked) confirms valid AsyncData struct\n3. If ASYNC_DATA_INITIALIZED (bit 0) not set, call WaitForAsyncCompletion\n4. Assert initialized flag is now set\n5. Return result value at offset 0x3c\n\nParameters:\n- pAsyncData (int*): Pointer to AsyncData structure (passed in ECX)\n\nReturns:\n- int: Result value stored at pAsyncData[0xf] (offset 0x3c)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x41737960: AsyncData magic signature ('Asy`' ASCII)\n- 0xfffffff0: Mask to clear lower 4 flag bits for signature check\n- 0x1: ASYNC_DATA_INITIALIZED flag (bit 0)\n- 0x3c (60): Offset of result value in AsyncData structure",
