      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Tests if a character is a blank (space or tab).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If CType version > 1, calls TestCharacterTypeMask with mask 0x8\n2. Otherwise, directly checks g_pbCharTypeTable for blank flag (0x8)\n\nParameters:\n- nChar (int): Character code to test\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if character is blank (space/tab), 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: _BLANK character type mask (isblank)",
