      "name": "ClearCharTypeTable",
      "signature": "undefined ClearCharTypeTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Clears the multibyte character type table and resets code page state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Zero-fill g_abCharTypeTable (0x40 dwords + 1 byte = 257 bytes)\n2. Clear cached code page identifier\n3. Clear multibyte flag\n4. Clear locale ID\n5. Clear code page data fields (1-3)\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nCalled when:\n- Code page is 0 (invalid/none)\n- GetCPInfo fails and g_fCodePageIsSpecial is set",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
