      "name": "StartBackgroundThread",
      "signature": "void StartBackgroundThread(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes and starts a background worker thread.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear shutdown flag (g_dwThreadShutdownFlag = 0)\n2. Create thread with LAB_6ff70220 as entry point\n3. Store thread handle in g_hBackgroundThread\n4. Set active flag (g_fBackgroundThreadActive = 1)\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void (thread handle stored globally)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Called by FogInit during initialization",
