      "name": "RestoreFPUControlWord",
      "signature": "void RestoreFPUControlWord(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Restores FPU control word after floating-point operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare saved control word with default (0x27f)\n2. Skip restore if already default precision\n3. Load saved control word to FPU via FLDCW\n4. Clean stack and return\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Stack top contains saved FPU control word (pushed by caller)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x27f: Default x87 FPU control word (round-to-nearest, 64-bit precision)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ComputePowerInternal: Caller that performs pow() calculation",
