      "name": "FreeTlsData",
      "signature": "void FreeTlsData(void * pTlsData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Frees thread-local storage data structure and resets TLS slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if TLS index is valid (not -1)\n2. Get TLS data from param or TlsGetValue\n3. Free all allocated fields at offsets 0x24, 0x28, 0x30, 0x38, 0x40, 0x44\n4. Free TLS table at 0x50 if not default table\n5. Free the TLS structure itself\n6. Clear TLS slot with TlsSetValue(NULL)\n\nParameters:\n- pTlsData (void*): TLS data structure, or NULL to retrieve from TLS slot\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24, 0x28, 0x30, 0x38, 0x40, 0x44, 0x50: Field offsets in TLS structure\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF): Invalid TLS index",
