      "name": "LogAppendFormat",
      "signature": "void LogAppendFormat(void * pLogContext, char * szFormat, ...)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Appends formatted text to log context with variadic arguments.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate szFormat is not NULL (assert on failure)\n2. If pLogContext is NULL, use default g_pLogContext (0x6ff87020)\n3. Build varargs pointer from stack\n4. Call internal log manager to append formatted string\n\nParameters:\n- pLogContext (void*): Log context, NULL uses global default\n- szFormat (char*): printf-style format string (required)\n- ... : Variadic arguments for format specifiers\n\nReturns:\n- void",
