      "name": "SetFpuControlWord",
      "signature": "void SetFpuControlWord(ushort wControlMask)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Configures FPU control word with precision settings and masked exceptions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract precision control bits (0x300 mask) from input\n2. Set exception mask bits (0x7F) to mask all FPU exceptions\n3. Load modified control word via FLDCW instruction\n\nParameters:\n- wControlMask (ushort): FPU control word with precision bits (0x300)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x300: Precision control bits mask (PC field)\n- 0x7F: Exception mask flags (all exceptions masked)",
