      "name": "ConvertFpuControlWordToFlags",
      "signature": "uint ConvertFpuControlWordToFlags(uint dwFpuControlWord)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Converts FPU control word bits to internal flag representation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Maps rounding mode bits: input 0x1\u21920x10, 0x4\u21920x8, 0x8\u21920x4, 0x10\u21920x2, 0x20\u21920x1\n2. Maps exception mask bit 0x2 to 0x80000\n3. Converts precision control (bits 0xC00): 0x400\u21920x100, 0x800\u21920x200, 0xC00\u21920x300\n4. Converts rounding control (bits 0x300): 0\u21920x20000, 0x200\u21920x10000\n5. Maps infinity control bit 0x1000 to 0x40000\n\nParameters:\n- dwFpuControlWord: x87 FPU control word value\n\nReturns:\n- Converted flags in internal representation format",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
