      "name": "ShiftRight96Bit",
      "signature": "void ShiftRight96Bit(uint * pdwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Performs logical right shift by 1 bit on a 96-bit value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save middle DWORD (pdwValue[1])\n2. Shift middle by 1, OR in high bit from top DWORD\n3. Shift top DWORD by 1\n4. Shift low by 1, OR in high bit from saved middle\n\nParameters:\n- pdwValue (uint*): Pointer to 3-DWORD (12-byte) array representing 96-bit value\n  - pdwValue[0]: Low 32 bits\n  - pdwValue[1]: Middle 32 bits\n  - pdwValue[2]: High 32 bits\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in-place)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:31be27c1480e9c363bab7437010362e2",
