      "name": "DequeueQueueData",
      "signature": "ushort DequeueQueueData(void * pContext, byte * pbDest, ushort wMaxSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "ushort",
      "comment": "Dequeues data from context's embedded queue structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pContext is non-NULL\n2. Pass queue at pContext+0x16c to ReceiveQueueData\n3. ReceiveQueueData copies data to pbDest up to wMaxSize\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Context structure with queue at offset 0x16c\n- pbDest (byte*): Destination buffer for dequeued data\n- wMaxSize (ushort): Maximum bytes to copy\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes copied on success, 0 if queue empty or error\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x16c (364): Offset to queue structure within context",
