      "name": "ConvertWideEnvironToMultiByte",
      "signature": "int ConvertWideEnvironToMultiByte(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Converts wide character environment strings to multibyte and registers them.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through g_fEnvironWideInit array of wide strings\n2. For each wide string, get required buffer size via WideCharToMultiByte\n3. Allocate buffer and convert wide string to multibyte (CP_ACP=1)\n4. Register converted string via FUN_6ff7db70\n\nParameters:\n- None (reads from global g_fEnvironWideInit)\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success (all strings converted)\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF) on failure (conversion error or allocation failure)",
