      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "ushort",
      "comment": "Fetches a 16-bit word from a varargs pointer array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Advance varargs pointer by one dword (4 bytes)\n2. Return lower 16 bits of previous dword value\n\nParameters:\n- ppVarArgs (uint**): Pointer to varargs array pointer\n\nReturns:\n- ushort: Lower 16-bit word from consumed vararg slot\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FetchVarArgDword: Fetches full 32-bit dword\n- ReadVarArgsUint64: Fetches 64-bit value",
