      "signature": "void * OpenFileStream(char * lpszPath, char * szMode, uint dwShareMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Opens a file stream with the specified path, mode, and share mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate file stream structure via FUN_6ff77b98\n2. If allocation fails, return NULL\n3. Open file with mode parsing via FUN_6ff77a28\n4. Release critical section via FUN_6ff77532\n5. Return stream pointer (NULL on open failure)\n\nParameters:\n- lpszPath (char*): File path to open\n- szMode (char*): Mode string ('r','w','a' with 'b','t','+' modifiers)\n- dwShareMode (uint): File sharing flags (0x40 = default)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to file stream on success, NULL on failure",
