      "comment": "Cleanup handler registered with atexit() for the log message validated list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pass g_LogMessageListHead (0x6ffa0768) to validated list cleanup function\n2. The cleanup function iterates through all list entries and unlinks them\n\nParameters:\n- None (called by CRT atexit mechanism)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff6fd30: Registers this function with atexit()\n- FUN_6ff70e40: Validated list cleanup implementation",
