      "name": "ToLowerChar",
      "signature": "uint ToLowerChar(uint dwChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Converts uppercase ASCII character to lowercase.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Fast path: If locale disabled (g_nLocaleActive==0), convert A-Z by adding 0x20\n2. Locale path: Increment ref count, acquire lock 0x13 if shutting down\n3. Call locale-aware ToLowerCharLocale for conversion\n4. Release lock or decrement ref count\n\nParameters:\n- dwChar (uint): Character code to convert (typically 0x00-0xFF)\n\nReturns:\n- Lowercase character code if uppercase A-Z (0x41-0x5A)\n- Unchanged character code otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x41 (65): ASCII 'A'\n- 0x5A (90): ASCII 'Z'\n- 0x20 (32): Case offset (lowercase - uppercase)\n- 0x13 (19): Locale critical section index",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
