      "name": "GetFogStatePtr",
      "signature": "uint GetFogStatePtr(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Returns pointer to Fog system state data if initialized, NULL otherwise.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_fFogInitialized is non-zero\n2. If initialized, return address of Fog global state area (0x6ffa05a8)\n3. If not initialized, return 0\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- Address of Fog global state region on success\n- 0 (NULL) if Fog subsystem not yet initialized\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10019: Initializes Fog and sets g_fFogInitialized to 1",
