      "name": "SeekFile",
      "signature": "DWORD SeekFile(uint dwFileDescriptor, long lOffset, DWORD dwMoveMethod)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "DWORD",
      "comment": "Seeks to position in file associated with descriptor.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Convert file descriptor to Windows HANDLE via FUN_6ff7bca8\n2. If invalid handle, set errno to EBADF (9) and return -1\n3. Call SetFilePointer with offset and move method\n4. On error, translate DOS error via SetOsErrnoFromDosError\n5. On success, clear EOF flag (bit 1) in file table entry\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileDescriptor (uint): CRT file descriptor index\n- lOffset (LONG): Byte offset for seek operation\n- dwMoveMethod (DWORD): FILE_BEGIN=0, FILE_CURRENT=1, FILE_END=2\n\nReturns:\n- New file position on success, 0xFFFFFFFF (-1) on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): File table entry stride\n- 0xFD: Mask to clear EOF flag (bit 1)\n- 9: EBADF (bad file descriptor)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
