      "name": "PrintFormattedLocked",
      "signature": "int PrintFormattedLocked(FILE * pStream, byte * pszFormat)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Thread-safe formatted output to a FILE stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire stream lock via critical section\n2. Prepare output buffer for writing\n3. Process format string and write output\n4. Flush buffer if setup succeeded\n5. Release stream lock\n\nParameters:\n- pStream (FILE*): Target output stream\n- pszFormat (byte*): Printf-style format string\n- IMPLICIT: varargs on stack at offset 0x0c\n\nReturns:\n- Number of characters written on success\n- Negative value on error",
