      "name": "ScaleMantissaByPowerOf10",
      "signature": "void ScaleMantissaByPowerOf10(ushort * pMantissa, int nExponent, int nInitToZero)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Scales 80-bit extended precision mantissa by power of 10.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nExponent == 0, return immediately\n2. If nExponent < 0, use negative powers table (0x6ff86e50), negate exponent\n3. If nInitToZero != 0, zero the mantissa low word\n4. Loop while exponent != 0:\n   a. Advance table pointer by 0x54 bytes (7 entries)\n   b. Extract lowest 3 bits of exponent as multiplier index (0-7)\n   c. Shift exponent right by 3\n   d. If index != 0, multiply mantissa by power of 10^(2^index)\n   e. If multiplier >= 0x8000, copy to local buffer and decrement\n\nParameters:\n- pMantissa (ushort*): Pointer to 12-byte 80-bit mantissa buffer\n- nExponent (int): Decimal exponent to scale by (can be negative)\n- nInitToZero (int): If nonzero, initialize mantissa low word to zero\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in pMantissa buffer)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6ff86cf0: Positive powers of 10 table (80-bit extended format)\n- 0x6ff86e50: Negative powers of 10 table (80-bit extended format)\n- 0x54 (84): Table stride (7 entries * 12 bytes each)\n- 0x8000: Overflow threshold for mantissa adjustment",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:5da54fa8fcd8f9f672e8d39458e0992c",
