      "name": "BuildCodePageCharTypeTable",
      "signature": "void BuildCodePageCharTypeTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Builds character type and case mapping tables for the cached code page.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get code page info via GetCPInfo for g_dwCachedCodePage\n2. If valid DBCS code page:\n   a. Initialize 256-byte char table with identity mapping (0-255)\n   b. Mark lead byte ranges with spaces to skip in character processing\n   c. Call GetStringTypeWithConversion to get character type flags\n   d. Call LCMapStringWithConversion twice for upper/lower case mappings\n   e. For each char: set g_abCharTypeTable flags and populate g_abCaseMappingTable\n3. If code page invalid: use ASCII fallback (A-Z=upper, a-z=lower)\n\nParameters:\n- None (uses global g_dwCachedCodePage and g_dwLocaleId)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10: CT_UPPER flag - character is uppercase\n- 0x20: CT_LOWER flag - character is lowercase\n- 0x100: LCMAP_UPPERCASE flag\n- 0x200: LCMAP_LOWERCASE flag\n- 0x41/0x5a: 'A'/'Z' ASCII range\n- 0x60/0x7b: '`'/'z'+1 for lowercase range check\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_abCharTypeTable: Character type flags (upper/lower)\n- g_abCaseMappingTable: Maps chars to case-converted equivalents",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:63906d1f35f7842042066a6643d2050c",
