      "name": "AtomicExchange64",
      "signature": "void AtomicExchange64(longlong * pllDest, longlong * pllNewVal)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Atomically exchanges a 64-bit value using CMPXCHG8B.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load new 64-bit value from pllNewVal into EBX:ECX\n2. Load current 64-bit value from pllDest into EDX:EAX\n3. Execute LOCK CMPXCHG8B to atomically compare and swap\n4. Retry loop until exchange succeeds (handles contention)\n\nParameters:\n- pllDest (longlong*): Pointer to 64-bit destination to exchange\n- pllNewVal (longlong*): Pointer to new 64-bit value to store\n\nReturns:\n- void (operates in-place)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitInterlockSystem: Initializes interlocked operation system\n- Ordinal_10055: Uses this for atomic 64-bit operations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
