      "name": "AreDwords3AllZero",
      "signature": "bool AreDwords3AllZero(uint * pdwArray)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Checks if 3 consecutive dwords are all zero.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through 3 dwords starting at pdwArray\n2. If any dword is non-zero, return false\n3. If all 3 dwords are zero, return true\n\nParameters:\n- pdwArray (uint*): Pointer to array of 3 dwords\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if all 3 dwords are zero\n- false (0) if any dword is non-zero\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff7977f: Caller - uses for FP mantissa zero check",
