      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sends data over a socket connection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get socket handle from pContext+0x10\n2. Call send() with buffer and length\n3. Return success/failure status\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnused (uint): Unused parameter (passed in ECX)\n- pContext (void*): Socket context, socket handle at offset 0x10\n- szBuffer (char*): Data buffer to send\n- nLength (int): Number of bytes to send\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success\n- 0 on failure (calls WSAGetLastError internally)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10: Offset to SOCKET handle in context structure",
