      "name": "StrCat",
      "signature": "char * StrCat(char * szDest, char * szSrc)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "char *",
      "comment": "Concatenates source string to end of destination string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Find null terminator of destination string using DWORD scan\n2. Handle misaligned initial bytes via byte-at-a-time copy\n3. Copy source string to destination end using DWORD scan\n4. Write final bytes and null terminator\n\nParameters:\n- szDest (char*): Destination string to append to\n- szSrc (char*): Source string to append\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to szDest (destination buffer)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7efefeff: Null byte detection constant\n- 0x81010100: Null byte mask for testing",
