      "name": "InitDataArray",
      "signature": "void InitDataArray(void * pDataArray)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a data array structure to its default state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set fValid flag to 1 (0x108)\n2. Set nCurrentIndex to -1 (0x110)\n3. Clear nCount (0x114) and nUsed (0x10c) to 0\n4. Set wFlags to 0x8000 (0x118)\n5. Loop through all entries (nEntryCount at 0x100)\n6. Clear first word of each entry to 0\n\nParameters:\n- pDataArray (void*): Pointer to data array structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nStructure Layout:\n- 0x100: nEntryCount (max entries)\n- 0x104: nEntrySize (stride per entry)\n- 0x108: fValid (validation flag)\n- 0x10c: nUsed (entries in use)\n- 0x110: nCurrentIndex (current iteration index)\n- 0x114: nCount (active count)\n- 0x118: wFlags (status flags, 0x8000=initialized)\n- 0x11c: pEntries (pointer to entry data)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:897b74b367a8bb272aa1de687b307ffb",
