      "name": "SehLocalUnwindHelper",
      "signature": "void SehLocalUnwindHelper(void * pExceptionFrame)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Helper for SEH local stack unwinding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract frame pointer from exception frame at offset 0x0\n2. Extract try level from offset 0x1c  \n3. Extract scope table from offset 0x18\n4. Call __local_unwind2 to unwind local stack\n\nParameters:\n- pExceptionFrame (void*): Pointer to EXCEPTION_REGISTRATION structure\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18: Offset to scope table in exception frame\n- 0x1c: Offset to try level in exception frame",
