      "name": "ComputeCrc16Hash",
      "signature": "ushort ComputeCrc16Hash(byte * pbString)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "ushort",
      "comment": "Computes case-insensitive CRC16 hash of a null-terminated string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize hash to 0xFFFF\n2. For each character: convert to lowercase via FUN_6ff7207d\n3. XOR low byte of hash with character byte\n4. Look up result in g_awCrc16Table, XOR with hash >> 2\n5. Return final 16-bit hash value\n\nParameters:\n- pbString (byte*): Null-terminated input string\n\nReturns:\n- CRC16 hash value (0xFFFF if empty string)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
