      "name": "GetSineValue",
      "signature": "float10 GetSineValue(float10 * __return_storage_ptr__, uint dwAngle)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "float10 *",
      "comment": "Returns sine value from precomputed lookup table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Mask angle to 9 bits (0-511 range)\n2. Index into 512-entry sine table\n3. Return float value from table\n\nParameters:\n- dwAngle (uint): Angle in 512ths of a circle (0-511 wraps)\n\nReturns:\n- Sine value as float10 (0.0 to 1.0 range for quarter cycle)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1ff (511): Mask for 512-entry table wraparound\n- 512 entries: Full circle divided into 512 steps\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10083/GetCosineValue: Same table with 0x80 phase offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
