      "name": "InitializeCriticalSectionWrapper",
      "signature": "void InitializeCriticalSectionWrapper(dword * pCritSecWrapper)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a critical section wrapper structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clears wrapper state fields at offsets 0x1c and 0x20\n2. Clears lock count at offset 0x00\n3. Initializes CRITICAL_SECTION at offset 0x04 via WinAPI\n\nParameters:\n- pCritSecWrapper (dword*): Pointer to CritSecWrapper structure (0x24+ bytes)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset | Size | Field              |\n|--------|------|--------------------|\n| 0x00   | 4    | Lock count/state   |\n| 0x04   | 24   | CRITICAL_SECTION   |\n| 0x1c   | 4    | Reserved/state     |\n| 0x20   | 4    | Reserved/state     |",
