      "name": "InitializeWinsock",
      "signature": "SOCKET InitializeWinsock(int nNetCtx, u_short wPort)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "SOCKET",
      "comment": "Initialize Winsock and create a listening socket on the specified port.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set network context initialization flag at offset 0x884\n2. Call WSAStartup with version 1.1 (0x101)\n3. On failure, return 0\n4. On success, call FUN_6ff66b30 to create and bind the socket\n\nParameters:\n- nNetCtx (int): Network context structure address\n- wPort (u_short): Port number to bind\n\nReturns:\n- SOCKET handle on success, 0 on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x101: Winsock version 1.1\n- 0x884: Network context init flag offset",
