      "name": "AllocHeapArena",
      "signature": "void * * AllocHeapArena(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void * *",
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a new heap arena for small-block allocation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwHeapInitFlag == -1, use static arena; else HeapAlloc 0x2020 bytes\n2. VirtualAlloc reserves 0x400000 bytes (4MB), commits first 0x10000 (64KB)\n3. Link arena into doubly-linked list via g_pArenaListHead/Tail\n4. Initialize arena header: pEnd (+0x14), pFreeListHead (+0x8), pCommitEnd (+0xC), pBase (+0x10)\n5. Initialize bucket table (0x400 entries) with size/avail pairs\n6. Zero committed pages and init page headers with free list pointers\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to arena header on success, NULL on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x2020: Arena header size (8224 bytes)\n- 0x400000: Reserved virtual memory (4MB)\n- 0x10000: Initially committed memory (64KB)\n- 0x400: Number of bucket entries (1024)\n- 0xF0/0xF1: Page available/total size markers\n- 0x1000: Page size (4KB)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
