      "name": "ParseFileModeAndOpen",
      "signature": "uint * ParseFileModeAndOpen(LPCSTR lpszFilePath, char * szMode, uint dwShareMode, uint * pdwStreamCtx)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint *",
      "comment": "Parses fopen-style mode string and opens file with appropriate flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Parse base mode character (r/w/a) to set initial open and stream flags\n2. For 'r': read-only mode, stream flags |= 1\n3. For 'w': write mode with O_TRUNC|O_CREAT (0x301), stream flags |= 2\n4. For 'a': append mode with O_APPEND|O_CREAT (0x109), stream flags |= 2\n5. Iterate through modifier characters until NUL or invalid char\n6. Apply modifier flags (b,t,+,R,S,D,T,c,n) to open/stream flags\n7. Call low-level file open FUN_6ff7bdfe with computed flags\n8. On success, initialize stream context and increment open count\n9. On failure, return NULL\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFilePath (LPCSTR): Path to file to open\n- szMode (char*): Mode string (r,w,a with optional b,t,+,R,S,D,T,c,n modifiers)\n- dwShareMode (uint): File sharing mode flags passed to CreateFile\n- pdwStreamCtx (uint*): Output stream context structure (32 bytes)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to pdwStreamCtx on success\n- NULL on invalid mode or file open failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x109: Append mode (O_APPEND | O_CREAT)\n- 0x301: Write mode (O_TRUNC | O_CREAT)\n- 0x1a4: Default permissions (octal 0644)\n- 0x8000: Binary mode flag (b)\n- 0x4000: Text mode flag (t)\n- 0x1000: Temporary file (T)\n- 0x80: Read/write mode in stream flags (+)\n\nStream Context Layout:\n- [0x00]: Reserved (set to 0)\n- [0x04]: Reserved (set to 0)\n- [0x08]: Reserved (set to 0)\n- [0x0C]: Stream flags\n- [0x10]: File descriptor\n- [0x1C]: Reserved (set to 0)",
