      "name": "SeekFileWithLock",
      "signature": "DWORD SeekFileWithLock(uint dwFileDesc, long lOffset, DWORD dwOrigin)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "DWORD",
      "comment": "Seeks file position with thread-safe locking (_lseek wrapper).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate file descriptor against g_dwMaxFileDesc\n2. Check file table entry flag bit 0x1 for valid open file\n3. Acquire file lock via FUN_6ff7bcea\n4. Call SeekFile to perform actual SetFilePointer operation\n5. Release lock via FUN_6ff7bd49\n6. Return new position or -1 on error\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileDesc (uint): CRT file descriptor index\n- lOffset (LONG): Byte offset to seek\n- dwOrigin (DWORD): Origin - 0=SEEK_SET, 1=SEEK_CUR, 2=SEEK_END\n\nReturns:\n- New file position on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF (-1) on error (sets errno=9 EBADF)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1: File valid/open flag in file entry\n- 0x24 (36): File table entry stride\n- 9: EBADF (bad file descriptor) errno value",
