      "signature": "dword ExchangeStructArrayValue(void * pStruct, int nIndex, dword dwNewValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Gets and optionally sets a DWORD in an array at offset 0xBA8 in a structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read DWORD from pStruct + 0xBA8 + (nIndex * 4)\n2. If dwNewValue is non-zero, write dwNewValue to same location\n3. Return the original value\n\nParameters:\n- pStruct (void*): Pointer to structure containing array at offset 0xBA8\n- nIndex (int): Array index (0-based)\n- dwNewValue (dword): New value to set; 0 means read-only\n\nReturns:\n- Previous value at the indexed location\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xBA8 (2984): Offset to DWORD array within structure",
