      "name": "IsWindowsNT",
      "signature": "bool IsWindowsNT(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Checks if the operating system is Windows NT or later.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Zero-initializes OSVERSIONINFOA structure (0x25 DWORDs)\n2. Sets dwOSVersionInfoSize to 0x94 (148 bytes)\n3. Calls GetVersionExA to query OS version\n4. Returns true if dwPlatformId == VER_PLATFORM_WIN32_NT (2)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- true: Running on Windows NT/2000/XP or later\n- false: GetVersionExA failed or running on Win9x/ME\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x25 (37): Number of DWORDs to zero (148/4 = 37)\n- 0x94 (148): sizeof(OSVERSIONINFOA)\n- 2: VER_PLATFORM_WIN32_NT constant",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
