      "name": "InitPerformanceTimingSubsystem",
      "signature": "void InitPerformanceTimingSubsystem(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes the performance timing subsystem.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query performance counter frequency via QueryPerformanceFrequency\n2. Calculate ticks per millisecond (freq / 1000)\n3. Calculate ticks per microsecond (freq / 1000000)\n4. Zero-initialize PERFORMANCE_ACCUMULATOR array (0x6000 DWORDs = 98304 bytes)\n5. Store initial tick count from GetTickCount\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nCalled From:\n- Ordinal_10019 (system initialization)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3E8 (1000): Milliseconds per second\n- 0xF4240 (1000000): Microseconds per second\n- 0x6000 (24576): Number of DWORDs to clear in accumulator array",
