      "name": "CheckCapsLockDebugOutput",
      "signature": "void CheckCapsLockDebugOutput(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Checks if Caps Lock is active and triggers debug output if so.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query Caps Lock key state via GetKeyState(VK_CAPITAL)\n2. Check if toggle bit (bit 0) is set in return value\n3. If Caps Lock is ON, call internal debug output function\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14: VK_CAPITAL (Caps Lock virtual key code)\n- 0x1: Toggle state bit mask (low bit indicates ON state)",
