      "name": "SetNetworkParameters",
      "signature": "void SetNetworkParameters(int * pParams)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes global network configuration parameters from a 4-element array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy pParams[0] to g_nMaxConnections\n2. Store pParams[0]-1 to g_nMaxConnectionIndex\n3. Copy pParams[1] to g_nSendBufferSize\n4. Copy pParams[2] to g_nRecvBufferSize\n5. Copy pParams[3] to g_nTimeout\n\nParameters:\n- pParams (int*): Array of 4 network parameters [maxConn, sendBuf, recvBuf, timeout]\n\nReturns:\n- void",
