      "name": "FindVirtualHeapBlock",
      "signature": "int FindVirtualHeapBlock(byte * pbAddress, uint * * ppHeapNode, uint * pdwPageBase)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Searches virtual heap linked list for the region containing a given address.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through heap region linked list starting at g_SbhSentinelNode\n2. For each node, check if address falls within node's range (ppNode[4]..ppNode[5])\n3. Validate address is 16-byte aligned (& 0xF == 0)\n4. Validate address page offset is >= 0x100 (not in page header area)\n5. Output heap node pointer and page base address\n6. Return calculated block index within the page\n\nParameters:\n- pbAddress (byte*): Address to search for in heap regions\n- ppHeapNode (uint**): Output - pointer to containing heap region node\n- pdwPageBase (uint*): Output - base address of page containing block\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Address not found or invalid alignment\n- Non-zero: Block index within page (page_base + ((addr - page_base - 0x100) >> 4) + 8)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xF: Alignment mask - blocks must be 16-byte aligned\n- 0x100: Page header size - offset to first allocatable block\n- 0xFFF: Page offset mask for extracting page-relative position\n- 0xFFFFF000: Page base mask for 4KB page alignment",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d9739637e22d71ed7283b5bc68a6c4ac",
