      "name": "InitValidatedListHead",
      "signature": "void InitValidatedListHead(ValidatedListHead * pListHead)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a validated linked list head structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set pSentinel (offset 4) to point to itself (empty list sentinel)\n2. Clear dwCount (offset 0) to zero\n3. Store ~pSentinel in dwCheckValue (offset 8) for integrity validation\n\nParameters:\n- pListHead (ValidatedListHead*): Pointer to list head structure to initialize\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset | Field        | Description                       |\n|--------|--------------|-----------------------------------|\n| 0x00   | dwCount      | Element count (initialized to 0)  |\n| 0x04   | pSentinel    | Self-referential sentinel pointer |\n| 0x08   | dwCheckValue | Bitwise NOT of pSentinel          |\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Caller at 0x6ff6fd35 uses this for list initialization",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
