      "name": "GetAdjustedCount",
      "signature": "int GetAdjustedCount(void * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Returns base count from context structure, adding 1 if increment flag is set.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read base count from pContext+0x8\n2. Check increment flag at pContext+0xC\n3. If flag non-zero, add 1 to count\n4. Return adjusted count\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Pointer to context structure with count at +0x8 and flag at +0xC\n\nReturns:\n- int: Base count, incremented by 1 if flag is set\n\nStructure Offsets:\n- +0x8: Base count (int)\n- +0xC: Increment flag (int, non-zero to add 1)",
