      "name": "HandleAbnormalTermination",
      "signature": "void HandleAbnormalTermination(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Handles abnormal program termination (abort).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Write runtime error message R6010 via _NMSG_WRITE(10)\n2. Raise SIGABRT signal (0x16) to invoke registered signal handlers\n3. Exit with code 3 indicating abnormal termination\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- Does not return (calls __exit)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0A (10): R6010 \"abort() has been called\" error code\n- 0x16 (22): SIGABRT signal number\n- 0x03 (3): Exit code for abnormal termination\n\nRelated Functions:\n- _NMSG_WRITE: Displays runtime error message\n- FUN_6ff7c72a: Signal dispatch handler\n- __exit: Process termination",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
