      "comment": "Saves CPU context for SEH local unwinding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load base address of global unwind context structure (0x6ff86238)\n2. Store [EBP+8] (return address/arg) at offset +8\n3. Store EAX at offset +4\n4. Store EBP at offset +0xC\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains value to preserve\n- IMPLICIT: EBP points to caller's stack frame\n- IMPLICIT: [EBP+8] contains return address or argument\n\nReturns:\n- void (context saved to global structure)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __local_unwind2: Caller that invokes exception handlers",
