      "name": "CoalesceSmallBlock",
      "signature": "void CoalesceSmallBlock(uint * pHeapHeader, int nBlockAddr)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Coalesces a freed small block with adjacent free blocks in SBH allocator.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute region index from block address (addr - base >> 15)\n2. Check if block is truly free (low bit of size tag == 0)\n3. Try coalescing with next block if free:\n   - Remove next block from its free list bucket\n   - Merge sizes together\n4. Try coalescing with previous block if free:\n   - Remove prev block from its free list bucket\n   - Merge sizes, adjust block pointer backward\n5. Insert coalesced block into appropriate size bucket\n6. Update bucket bitmaps (low 32/high 32 for buckets 0-31/32-63)\n7. Decrement region block count; if region empty:\n   - Decommit cached region pages via VirtualFree(MEM_DECOMMIT)\n   - If all pages decommitted, release entire region\n\nParameters:\n- pHeapHeader (uint*): SBH heap header (bitmaps at [0],[1], base at [3], data at [4])\n- nBlockAddr (int): Address of freed block (points past size tag)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000 (32KB): Region page size\n- 0x204 (516): Free list array stride per region\n- 0x144 (324): Free list offset in region data\n- 0x44/0xC4 (68/196): Bitmap array offsets (low/high buckets)\n- 0x3F (63): Max bucket index\n- 0x14 (20): Region header stride (5 DWORDs)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:ef5171f8f7487cff01081036951ae8fa",
