      "signature": "void ExecuteFunctionPointerTable(void * * ppfnStart, void * * ppfnEnd)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Executes all non-null function pointers in a table range.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate from ppfnStart to ppfnEnd\n2. For each entry, check if function pointer is non-null\n3. If non-null, call the function via indirect CALL\n4. Advance to next entry (4 bytes)\n\nParameters:\n- ppfnStart (void**): Start of function pointer array\n- ppfnEnd (void**): End boundary of function pointer array (exclusive)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
