      "name": "GetLcidFromCodePage",
      "signature": "uint GetLcidFromCodePage(uint dwCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Maps Windows code page ID to corresponding locale ID (LCID).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if code page is Japanese Shift-JIS (932)\n2. Check if code page is Chinese Simplified GB2312 (936)\n3. Check if code page is Korean (949)\n4. Check if code page is Chinese Traditional Big5 (950)\n5. Return 0 for unsupported code pages\n\nParameters:\n- dwCodePage (uint): Windows code page identifier\n\nReturns:\n- LCID for supported code pages, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3a4 (932): Japanese Shift-JIS -> LCID 0x411\n- 0x3a8 (936): Chinese Simplified -> LCID 0x804\n- 0x3b5 (949): Korean -> LCID 0x412\n- 0x3b6 (950): Chinese Traditional -> LCID 0x404",
