      "name": "UpdateHuffmanStatistics",
      "signature": "void UpdateHuffmanStatistics(byte * pbSrcData, uint dwByteCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Updates Huffman encoding statistics by processing source bytes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through each byte in the source buffer\n2. For each byte value, increment its frequency count in g_adwHuffmanSrc (64-bit counter with overflow)\n3. Accumulate total bit lengths from g_abBitLengthCopy lookup table\n4. Calculate compressed byte estimate: (totalBits + 7) / 8 + 1, adding +1 if result > 0xEF\n5. Update global state counters (64-bit) for raw and compressed totals\n\nParameters:\n- pbSrcData (byte*): Pointer to source data buffer to analyze\n- dwByteCount (uint): Number of bytes to process\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x07: Rounding bits for byte alignment\n- 0x03: Right shift for division by 8\n- 0xEF (239): Threshold for adding extra byte to estimate\n- 0xFFFFFFFE: Used for carry detection (check if value > 0xFFFFFFFE)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
