      "comment": "Virtual destructor wrapper for ExceptionInfo objects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call DestroyExceptionInfo to clean up object contents\n2. If byFlags & 1 is set, free the memory via OperatorScalarDelete\n3. Return the original this pointer\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (void*): Pointer to ExceptionInfo object to destroy\n- byFlags (byte): Deletion flags (bit 0 = free memory after destruction)\n\nReturns:\n- Original pThis pointer (standard destructor behavior)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DestroyExceptionInfo: Actual destruction logic\n- OperatorScalarDelete: Memory deallocation",
