      "signature": "void CheckPentiumFdivBug(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Checks for Pentium FDIV bug using OS API or fallback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get KERNEL32 module handle\n2. Attempt to resolve IsProcessorFeaturePresent dynamically\n3. If found, call with PF_FLOATING_POINT_PRECISION_ERRATA (0)\n4. If API unavailable, fall back to HasFdivBug manual check\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored internally by callee)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0: PF_FLOATING_POINT_PRECISION_ERRATA feature ID\n\nRelated Functions:\n- HasFdivBug: Manual FDIV bug detection fallback\n- InitializeFpuEnvironment: Caller that uses result",
