      "name": "TransmitSocketData",
      "signature": "int TransmitSocketData(FogSocketContext * pContext, char * szBuffer, int nLength)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sends data on a socket and handles connection reset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call send() with socket from pContext->hSocket\n2. Check WSAGetLastError for WSAECONNRESET\n3. If disconnected, log error and close socket\n4. Return bytes sent (or 0 on disconnect)\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (FogSocketContext*): Socket context with hSocket at +8\n- szBuffer (char*): Data buffer to send\n- nLength (int): Number of bytes to send\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes sent on success\n- 0 if connection was reset (socket closed)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x274c (10060): WSAECONNRESET - connection reset by peer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
