      "name": "DataArrayGetEntry",
      "signature": "void * DataArrayGetEntry(DataArray * pDataArray, int nPackedIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Retrieves an entry from a DataArray by packed index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return NULL if index is -1 (invalid sentinel)\n2. Extract array index from high word of packed index\n3. Validate index is within bounds [0, nMaxEntries)\n4. Verify array is valid (fValid flag)\n5. Calculate entry offset: nEntrySize * nArrayIndex\n6. Read entry's validation word at entry start\n7. Return entry pointer if validation passes, else NULL\n\nParameters:\n- pDataArray (DataArray*): Pointer to DataArray structure\n- nPackedIndex (int): Packed index (high word=array index, low word=validation)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to entry on success, NULL on invalid index or validation failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF): Invalid index sentinel",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
