      "name": "ShowRuntimeMessageBox",
      "signature": "int ShowRuntimeMessageBox(char * lpszText, char * lpszCaption, uint dwType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Displays a message box using dynamically loaded user32.dll.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If MessageBoxA not loaded, load user32.dll\n2. Get proc addresses for MessageBoxA, GetActiveWindow, GetLastActivePopup\n3. Get active window and its last active popup for parent\n4. Call MessageBoxA with resolved parent hwnd\n\nParameters:\n- lpszText (char*): Message text to display\n- lpszCaption (char*): Dialog caption\n- dwType (uint): MessageBox style flags (MB_OK, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- MessageBox return value (IDOK, IDCANCEL, etc.) or 0 on failure",
