      "name": "CaptureThreadStackTrace",
      "signature": "void CaptureThreadStackTrace(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Captures stack trace of current thread for exception reporting.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if imagehlp.dll is loaded (g_fImageHelpLoaded)\n2. If not loaded, log error and return early\n3. Duplicate current thread handle via GetCurrentProcess/GetCurrentThread/DuplicateHandle\n4. Call GenerateStackTraceReport with exception record and thread handle\n5. Close duplicated handle\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: [ESP+0x10] contains exception record pointer\n- IMPLICIT: Exception record at [pRecord+0x4] contains context info\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nNotes:\n- Called from InitSymbolHelper during exception handling\n- Uses duplicated handle to avoid locking issues with current thread",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
