      "name": "ManageLogFileRotation",
      "signature": "void ManageLogFileRotation(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Manages log file rotation and archival.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Every 500ms, check for \"forklogs\" folder trigger\n2. If forklogs exists, delete it and set archive flag\n3. Close stale log handles (15s idle or 5s since write) or all if archiving\n4. If archiving, create timestamped folder (YY_MM_DD_HH_MM)\n5. Move all *.d2*.txt files to archive folder\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 500 (0x1f4): Rotation check interval (ms)\n- 15000 (0x3a98): Idle timeout before close (ms)\n- 5000 (0x1388): Write timeout before close (ms)\n- 0x100 (256): Stride for log filename array\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH buffer size",
