      "name": "_NMSG_WRITE",
      "signature": "void _NMSG_WRITE(uint dwMsgId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Displays MSVC CRT runtime error message.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search g_RuntimeMsgTable for matching dwMsgId\n2. If found and console mode (g_dwAppType==1) or message boxes enabled:\n   - Write error string directly to stderr via WriteFile\n3. Else if GUI mode and dwMsgId != 0xFC:\n   - Get module filename (truncate to 60 chars with \"...\" if too long)\n   - Build message: \"Runtime Error!\n\nProgram: <path>\n\n<error>\"\n   - Display via FUN_6ff7c6a1 (MessageBox wrapper)\n\nParameters:\n- dwMsgId (uint): Runtime error code (R6002, R6016, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFFFFFFFF4: STD_ERROR_HANDLE (-12)\n- 0x3C (60): Max display length for module path\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH buffer size\n- 0xFC (252): Special message ID to skip GUI display\n- 0x12010: MB_ICONEXCLAMATION | MB_OK | MB_TASKMODAL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:ff7880d11813b11bf7ac9bc241be5c60",
